PKM Go UAPI bindings
====================

The Go declarations in this module are generated mechanically from the PKM
userspace ABI headers under uapi/pkm. Those headers are the source of truth,
and this generated mirror carries the same licence:

    GPL-2.0-only WITH Linux-syscall-note

The complete GPL-2.0-only text is in LICENSE.GPL-2.0-only. The complete
Linux-syscall-note exception is in LICENSE.Linux-syscall-note. The exception
means normal userspace programs may use this UAPI without becoming derivative
works of the kernel.

Regenerate zconst.go and ztypes.go with gen.sh; do not edit them by hand.
